          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wa mdamu, zighana cha kwa Waamoni kuwifunyire wulodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wizere Waamoni wisikire seji ini Bwana MLUNGU nawuyaghamba: Mwawuyaseka, ‘Ahaa!’ aighu ya Andu kwapo kwa Wueli angu korelushiroghe, na aighu ya isanga ja Israeli angu jeresighiloghe iduu, na aighu ya wandu wa Juda angu weredwaloghe wunyika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa wundu ugho nichamngira mikonunyi kwa wandu wa mashariki wimmbuse. Wichabonya kambi na kukaia aghadi konyu; wichaja matunda ghenyu na kunywa mariwa ghenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichabonya muzi ghwa Raba ghukaie mlamba gholishira ngamila, na isanga ja Waamoni jiwuye maranu gha mfugho. Aho niko mchaamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
