              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nani moni nichailekeria iyo mizi yawo iko mpakenyi ghwawo ikabo; mizi iko mpakenyi iboie kuchumba, iyo Beth-jeshimothi, Baal-meoni, na Kiriathaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichaifunya iyo mizi chiaimweri na Waamoni, na kuwingira mikonunyi kwa wandu wa mashariki, wiwibonye wikaie wandu wawo, hata wisewuekumbukwa sena aghadi ya iro mbari ra wandu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nani nichaitanya Moabu, nawo wichamanya kukaia ini ne BWANA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
