        },
        {
          "text": "nanimoni nichaghorua mkonu ghwapo nikabe Edomu; nichabwagha mdamu na nyamandu, na kusigha ijo isanga iduu, kufuma Temani hata Dedani, wandu wose wichabwaghwa kwa lufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
