          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichalipa ngenga aighu ya Edomu kwa kuwitumia wandu wapo Israeli, nawo wichawikaba Waedomu kunughana na machu ghapo, nawo wichamanya ngenga yapo, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
